      "payload_effect": "When the rare trigger condition above occurs, the alternate WIDTH==24 branch forces the registered `full` output to incorrectly deassert for exactly one clock cycle even though the FIFO is actually full, allowing an extra word to be pushed that overwrites unread data via pointer wraparound collision.",
